# Anthropic (Claude) API key -- only needed if you run any stage with
# --provider claude, or set CVTAILOR_LLM_PROVIDER=claude.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
#
# To use: copy this file to anthropic_key.txt (drop the .example
# suffix) in this same folder, and replace the placeholder line below
# with your real key. anthropic_key.txt is gitignored -- it will never
# be committed once created. This .example file IS tracked, so a fresh
# clone always has the right filename to fill in.
#
# The pipeline currently reads ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from the environment
# (the Anthropic SDK's own default) rather than this file directly --
# set the env var for now; wiring a direct file-based loader here is a
# planned follow-up, not yet implemented.

PLACEHOLDER_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_REAL_KEY
